@page
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "E-Way provider readiness"; }
<div id="eway-workspace"><h1>E-Way provider readiness</h1><div id="eway-message" class="alert alert-danger" role="alert" hidden></div><div class="card card-body"><p id="eway-provider-status" role="status">Checking authorized integration capabilities…</p><p>Sandbox and production generation, status refresh, cancellation and transport/validity updates are not enabled. This installation has no authorized adapter, stored taxpayer credentials or verified provider connection.</p><p>The provider-specific contract, sandbox credentials, approved endpoints/encryption requirements, credential storage, onboarding, provider limits, fees and genuine response verification must be completed before enabling automatic operations.</p><p>No StockFlow monthly numeric quota is implemented. Provider capacity and costs are separate; this is not a government entitlement or an unlimited provider contract.</p><a href="https://docs.ewaybillgst.gov.in/apidocs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official API documentation</a><a href="/EWayBills">Return to preparation register</a></div></div>
@section Scripts {<script src="~/js/sales-common.js" asp-append-version="true"></script><script src="~/js/ewaybills.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>}
@section Styles {<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/ewaybills.css" asp-append-version="true" />}
